ICS firewall rule (Palo Alto):
```
rule deny {
  from trust;
  to dmz;
  source any;
  destination any;
  service modbus-tcp;
  application any;
  action drop;
  profile-setting group vulnerability-protection {
    signature "DOPSoft Modbus Length Overflow"
  }
}
```
Mitigation:  Delta patch 4.01.00, enable Modbus/TCP length validation in PLC firmware, and disable port 502 in firewall ACL.
